            \n\
            main.vl:44:9: gpu.state: copy_buffer's destination, its third argument (a buffer of 64 bytes), is mapped (map_read): the copy would change its view",
    },
    Explain {
        code: "gpu.unsupported",
        severity: "error (run time)",
        means: "A capability this device does not have: compute, rendering, textures, \
